WEBVTT

00:27:01.454 --> 00:27:09.329
That's that's really interesting. How do
you view the impact of A.I. on jobs?

00:27:09.371 --> 00:27:14.413
There's obviously been the familiar story
is that every White-Collar job is now

00:27:14.746 --> 00:27:18.996
up for destruction. What's
what's your view there?

00:27:20.371 --> 00:27:24.579
You know, it's I think it's always
hard to make these predictions.

00:27:24.746 --> 00:27:26.413
That is definitely the familiar story now.

00:27:29.246 --> 00:27:33.329
Five years ago, it was every blue collar
job is up for destruction,